0..73 Comment "// The reads of an inert field that are refused, and the marks that stand"
74..85 Comment "// nowhere."
86..88 Comment "//"
89..165 Comment "// Only the manifest step and another inert declaration read an inert field."
166..244 Comment "// A mark on a sort has no field to make inert, and a module\'s member takes no"
245..253 Comment "// mark."
254..256 Comment "//"
257..329 Comment "// A read by a path, by a name inside the model or off a model binder is"
330..406 Comment "// refused `InertRead` at the read. A content read of an inert definition is"
407..476 Comment "// refused so too. A misplaced mark is refused malformed at its name."
477..479 Comment "//"
480..534 Comment "// - see: #3029 — the mark and the refusal of a read"
535..590 Comment "// - see: #6141 — a top-level definition marked inert"
591..657 Comment "// - see: `model/modules/inert-field.gandr` — the reads admitted"
